### PR → Dashboard test requests
### Requires the VS Code "REST Client" extension (or any .http-compatible client).
### Click "Send Request" above each ### block to run it.

@baseUrl = https://vh-bitwininit.onrender.com
# @baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

### 1. Report PR #1 (alice) — introduces leak A
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/action-run
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "repo": "test/pr-check",
  "pr_number": 1,
  "user_id": "alice",
  "conclusion": "fail",
  "summary": { "total": 1, "errors": 1, "warnings": 0, "info": 0 },
  "findings": [
    {
      "rule_id": "LKG-R001",
      "severity": "ERROR",
      "message": "leak A",
      "location": { "file": "a.py", "line": 10, "column": 0 },
      "details": {}
    }
  ]
}

### 2. Report PR #2 (bob) — same leak A, should show as pre-existing
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/action-run
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "repo": "test/pr-check",
  "pr_number": 2,
  "user_id": "bob",
  "conclusion": "fail",
  "summary": { "total": 1, "errors": 1, "warnings": 0, "info": 0 },
  "findings": [
    {
      "rule_id": "LKG-R001",
      "severity": "ERROR",
      "message": "leak A",
      "location": { "file": "a.py", "line": 10, "column": 0 },
      "details": {}
    }
  ]
}

### 3. List PRs reported for this repo
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/repos/test%2Fpr-check/prs

### 4. PR #1 issues — expect is_new: true, first_seen_user alice
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/repos/test%2Fpr-check/prs/1/issues

### 5. PR #2 issues — expect is_new: false, first_seen_user alice (even though bob's run reported it)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/repos/test%2Fpr-check/prs/2/issues

### 6. PR #1 run log
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/repos/test%2Fpr-check/prs/1/logs

### 7. PR #2 run log
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/repos/test%2Fpr-check/prs/2/logs

### 8. Full repo run log (PR + push runs mixed)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/repos/test%2Fpr-check/logs

### 9. Repo-wide "current issues" (from whichever run reported last, PR or push)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/repos/test%2Fpr-check/issues

### 10. Global dashboard overview
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/overview
